              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Automatic' />
            <encodings>
              <text column='[federated.1tujo3f04bm6a3122rtjh0xznmlf].[none:Calculation_1283525936739471385:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>License Type Mapping</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Sales Users:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> Users with a user_type_c containing &quot;sales&quot; are categorized as either &quot;sales_users&quot; (if user_permissions_support_user is false) or &quot;full_users_sales&quot; (if user_permissions_support_user is true).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Service Users:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> Users with a user_type_c containing &quot;service&quot; are categorized as &quot;service_users&quot; (if user_permissions_support_user is true and permission.developer_name </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>does not</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> contain &quot;salesconsoleuser&quot; or is null) or &quot;full_users_service&quot; (if user_permissions_support_user is true </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>and</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> permission.developer_name </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>does</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> contain &quot;salesconsoleuser&quot;).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>API Users:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> Users where user_permissions_support_user is false </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>and</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> user_type_c does </run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>not</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> contain &quot;sales&quot; or &quot;service&quot; are classified as &quot;full_api_users.&quot;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Unmapped Users:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'> If a user&apos;s user_permissions_support_user, user_type_c, and permission.developer_name values don&apos;t match any of these rules, their license_type_mapping is set to &quot;unmapped.&quot;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>Historical users count:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Historical user counts are calculated by considering reactivated users as continuously active from their initial creation date until the present day. This approach is necessary because we lack a user status movement table, preventing us from tracking historical status changes.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>Tableau Source table: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#188038' fontname='Roboto Mono,Consolas,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='9'>`dh-central-salesforce-tech.dh_salesforce_userpermissions.historical_sf_users`</run>
                <run fontcolor='#202124' fontname='Roboto Mono,Consolas,Courier New,monospace' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1d1c1d'>* all tables from: `dh-central-salesforce-tech.dh_salesforce_userpermissions` (the update time diffrente from `fulfillment-dwh-production.curated_data_shared_salesforce.` -  this could be the reason for slight differences )</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <customized-label>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true'>Information</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-label>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='cell'>
                <format attr='vertical-align' value='bottom' />
                <format attr='text-align' value='center' />
              </style-rule>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='mark-labels-show' value='true' />
                <format attr='mark-labels-cull' value='true' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows />
        <cols />
      </table>
